{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01466","headline":"相和歌辞 阳春曲 · 温庭筠","name":"相和歌辞 阳春曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云母空窗晓烟薄，香昏龙气凝辉阁。\n霏霏雾雨杏花天，帘外春威着罗幕。\n曲栏伏槛金麒麟，沙苑芳郊连翠茵。\n廐马何能啮芳草，路人不敢随流尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01466.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01466","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}